OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBlustery band of rain will pass
OL,6,Feastwards over the region to start the
OL,7,Fday, but soon clears. Sunny spells and
OL,8,Foccasional showers then follow,
OL,9,Fperhaps becoming heavy at times,
OL,10,Fbefore becoming largely dry later in
OL,11,Fthe afternoon. Windy throughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny remaining showers will
OL,14,Fsoon fade, leaving a dry night with
OL,15,Fclear spells. Breezy initially but
OL,16,Fwinds gradually easing into the night.
OL,17,FBecoming chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
