OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,6,Fto Wednesday, but becoming
OL,7,Fincreasingly cloudy from late morning,
OL,8,Fthough remaining dry. Becoming windy
OL,9,Fby the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FWindy
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of rain Thursday,
OL,13,Fclearing overnight. Sunny spells and
OL,14,Fshowers Friday, with showers largely
OL,15,Fbecoming confined to the coast on
OL,16,FSaturday. Mild Thursday, otherwise
OL,17,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
